      "originalText": "CollectorStore [collector_store]\nDuckDB connection + unique run_id\nflush(state) / sample(state, instruments, ...)\nuniverse() / request() / checkpoint()\nstart(window) / summary() / finish() / close()\nCollector queries connection to restore universe.\nExisting database retains earlier runs.",
