      "text": "Scope: 13_collect_spy_validation.py. SessionCollector is the only class defined here; other boxes are imported collaborators or entry-point functions.\n[core] = collector_core.py. Arrows show the labeled interaction or data flow, not inheritance. No inheritance is declared in this script.\nLifecycle: reconnect attempts create a new Session + RawMarketStreamer; collector state and store survive retries; final flush preserves buffered data.\nOffline branch: main(--export) calls export_database(database, destination) without constructing SessionCollector or authenticating.",
